\subsection{Method \code{compute_capability()}}{
Compute Type 1 gage capability indices Cg and Cgk.

Cg measures repeatability alone; Cgk penalises for bias. Both are
referenced against the tolerance window scaled by \code{k_factor}.
Also computes study variation (6\emph{sigma and 5.15}sigma) and percent
repeatability metrics.
\subsection{Usage}{
\if{html}{\out{<div class="r">}}\preformatted{Type1Analyzer$compute_capability()}\if{html}{\out{</div>}}
}

\subsection{Returns}{
A named list of capability metrics (invisibly). Requires
\code{\link[=compute_bias]{compute_bias()}} to have been called first so that \code{sd_meas} and
\code{bias} are available in \code{self$results$statistics}.
}
}
